# Oscillatory estimates for a circle meridian

This file derives the unweighted angular circle estimates from the already
available estimates for the semicircle density.  The point is that the latter
becomes the `cos^2`-weighted angular integral after the usual sine change of
variables; one elementary integration by parts removes that weight.

This is deliberately independent of the geometric statement identifying the
circle surface measure with this angular parametrization.
